            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article analyzes 378 lethal outcomes of acute surgical diseases of the abdominal organs. Main direct causes of death were established. A system of prophylactic measures has been developed and introduced into practical work which have improved the quality of urgent surgical aid.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
